    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop aboard a Fate Train to the Spirit World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover strange landscapes and stranger characters. But be warned \u2013 the future of this world may very well rest on your knobby little shoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/f82ae7d87797216dac8036dc02e482a0.poster.avif?t=1746190037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/f82ae7d87797216dac8036dc02e482a0.webm?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/f82ae7d87797216dac8036dc02e482a0.mp4?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret personality test! Play to the end to see your results!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching storyline! (You\u2019ll only see about \u2153 in any playthrough)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unforgettable cast of weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dennis the Door is in it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 4 hours per run!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/db0234d839bf74e7e07fe0cebee6877e.poster.avif?t=1746190037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/db0234d839bf74e7e07fe0cebee6877e.webm?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/db0234d839bf74e7e07fe0cebee6877e.mp4?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RIDE THE FATE TRAIN EXPRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a colourful cast of Spirits, each with their own goals, struggles and motivations. Help them resolve their Unfinished Business (or not), and see where each CHOICE leads you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/7a06cccd18826d0672c3f6f345081ad3.poster.avif?t=1746190037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/7a06cccd18826d0672c3f6f345081ad3.webm?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/7a06cccd18826d0672c3f6f345081ad3.mp4?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>THIS IS A PERSONALITY TEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story of Freeride is shaped by your decisions, both Conscious and Unconscious. Go looking for a fight and you\u2019ll find one. Want drama? There\u2019s pllllllenty of that &lt;3\u00a0 Don\u2019t forget! The game is always watching you, and your Personality Outcome awaits at the end.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But no stress, there are no good or bad ways to play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/0a18efbe48be3e1632eebe43262506d3.poster.avif?t=1746190037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/0a18efbe48be3e1632eebe43262506d3.webm?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/0a18efbe48be3e1632eebe43262506d3.mp4?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BRANCHING STORYLINES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On each playthrough you will only see about a third of the full game. Each character helps you explore a facet of your personality, and your subconscious biases will have a real effect on their endings. Make your choices and play through your own adventure, then start a second run and rewrite history.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <br>--- <br> <br>Psst\u2026 Hey! You! Yes, YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll try the game, won\u2019t you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t you want to know Who You Really Are? \u2026Every human does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019ll make you feel better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Promise *P</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop aboard a Fate Train to the Spirit World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover strange landscapes and stranger characters. But be warned \u2013 the future of this world may very well rest on your knobby little shoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/f82ae7d87797216dac8036dc02e482a0.poster.avif?t=1746190037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/f82ae7d87797216dac8036dc02e482a0.webm?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/f82ae7d87797216dac8036dc02e482a0.mp4?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret personality test! Play to the end to see your results!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching storyline! (You\u2019ll only see about \u2153 in any playthrough)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unforgettable cast of weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dennis the Door is in it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 4 hours per run!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/db0234d839bf74e7e07fe0cebee6877e.poster.avif?t=1746190037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/db0234d839bf74e7e07fe0cebee6877e.webm?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/db0234d839bf74e7e07fe0cebee6877e.mp4?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RIDE THE FATE TRAIN EXPRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a colourful cast of Spirits, each with their own goals, struggles and motivations. Help them resolve their Unfinished Business (or not), and see where each CHOICE leads you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/7a06cccd18826d0672c3f6f345081ad3.poster.avif?t=1746190037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/7a06cccd18826d0672c3f6f345081ad3.webm?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/7a06cccd18826d0672c3f6f345081ad3.mp4?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>THIS IS A PERSONALITY TEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story of Freeride is shaped by your decisions, both Conscious and Unconscious. Go looking for a fight and you\u2019ll find one. Want drama? There\u2019s pllllllenty of that &lt;3\u00a0 Don\u2019t forget! The game is always watching you, and your Personality Outcome awaits at the end.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But no stress, there are no good or bad ways to play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/0a18efbe48be3e1632eebe43262506d3.poster.avif?t=1746190037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/0a18efbe48be3e1632eebe43262506d3.webm?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/0a18efbe48be3e1632eebe43262506d3.mp4?t=1746190037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BRANCHING STORYLINES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On each playthrough you will only see about a third of the full game. Each character helps you explore a facet of your personality, and your subconscious biases will have a real effect on their endings. Make your choices and play through your own adventure, then start a second run and rewrite history.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <br>--- <br> <br>Psst\u2026 Hey! You! Yes, YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll try the game, won\u2019t you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t you want to know Who You Really Are? \u2026Every human does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019ll make you feel better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Promise *P</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
